msgstr "フライト・乗継区間・出発スケジュールを手配します。"

msgid "Costs & Installments"
msgstr "費用と分割払い"

msgid "Record document costs and manage trainee installment payments and receipts."
msgstr "書類費用を記録し、研修生の分割払いと領収書を管理します。"

msgid "Apprenticeship in Japan → Return Home"
msgstr "日本での実習 → 帰国"

msgid "Track apprentices during their placement in Japan, including kaizen / problem-solving stories."
msgstr "日本での配属期間中の実習生を追跡します。改善（カイゼン）や問題解決の記録も含みます。"

msgid "Post-Apprentice — Return to Indonesia"
msgstr "実習修了後 — インドネシアへ帰国"

msgid "When the programme ends and the apprentice returns home, track their alumni status (employed, self-employed, continuing study…)."
msgstr "プログラム終了後に帰国した実習生の進路（就職・自営業・進学など）を追跡します。"

msgid "Dashboards & Reports"
msgstr "ダッシュボードとレポート"

msgid "Management monitors the whole pipeline through department dashboards and reports at any time."
msgstr "経営層は部門別ダッシュボードとレポートで全体の流れをいつでも把握できます。"

